bsolute Electromagnetic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Heat_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Heat Absorption\">Absolute Heat Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Nuclear_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Nuclear Absorption\">Absolute Nuclear Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Condition_Infinitum\" title=\"Condition Infinitum\">Condition Infinitum</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Beauty_Infinitum\" title=\"Beauty Infinitum\">Beauty Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence_Infinitum\" title=\"Intelligence Infinitum\">Intelligence Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Level_Infinitum\" title=\"Power Level Infinitum\">Power Level Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Infinitum\" title=\"Speed Infinitum\">Speed Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stamina_Infinitum\" title=\"Stamina Infinitum\">Stamina Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Strength_Infinitum\" title=\"Strength Infinitum\">Strength Infinitum</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ion_Attacks\" title=\"Ion Attacks\">Ion Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ion_Empowerment\" title=\"Ion Empowerment\">Ion Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Absolute\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Absolute\">Absolute Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Pinnacle_Condition\" title=\"Pinnacle Condition\">Pinnacle Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Accumulation\" title=\"Ionic Accumulation\">Ionic Accumulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Concentration\" title=\"Ionic Concentration\">Ionic Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Regenerative_Healing_Factor\" title=\"Regenerative Healing Factor\">Regenerative Healing Factor</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Capacitor\" title=\"Ionic Capacitor\">Ionic Capacit